{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"37240f583e914ba42181e29fd451e0e08b4e7c4e2af1563522da6f6a9285f631","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":58,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["真正的虔誠"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"「你要高聲呼喊，不要停止；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要放聲高呼，像響亮的號角。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要向我的子民宣告他們的過犯，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向雅各家宣告他們的罪惡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們天天尋求我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"樂於認識我的道，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像沒有丟棄他們上帝法令的正義之邦。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們向我求公義的判決，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"似乎樂於到我面前。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們說，『我們禁食，你為什麼不看呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們刻苦己身，你為什麼不理睬呢？』","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我說，『看啊，禁食之日你們仍然隨心所欲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"壓榨你們的工人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們一面禁食，一面爭鬧打鬥，惡拳相向。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"今天這種禁食不能使你們的禱告在高天蒙垂聽。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"難道這是我要的讓人刻苦己身的禁食日嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"難道像蘆葦一樣垂著頭、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"躺在麻布和爐灰上就是禁食嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這就是你們所謂的禁食，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所謂的蒙耶和華悅納的日子嗎？","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"「『我要的禁食豈不是，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"除去邪惡的鎖鏈，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"解開軛上的繩索，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"折斷一切的軛，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使受欺壓的人得到自由嗎？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"豈不是把你們的食物分給饑餓的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"接待無家可歸的窮人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"送衣服給赤身露體的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不躲避求助的親人嗎？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如果你們這樣做，你們的光必如晨光照耀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的創傷必迅速痊癒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的公義必在前引路，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華的榮耀必在後面保護你們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們求告，耶和華必應允；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們呼求，耶和華必回應。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如果你們不再欺壓、指責和譭謗，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如果你們給饑餓的人食物，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使困苦的人得飽足，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的光必照亮黑暗，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的黑夜必變成正午。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華必不斷地引導你們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你們在乾旱之地得到飽足，筋骨強健。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們必像灌溉充足的園子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又像湧流不息的泉源。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們必重修古老的荒場，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"重建遠古的根基。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們必被稱為修補斷垣、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"重建居民街道的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"「『如果你們遵守安息日，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在我的聖日不做私事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以安息日為樂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"尊崇耶和華的聖日，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不隨意行事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不妄自說話，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就必以耶和華為樂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華必使你們在地上受尊崇，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並享用你們先祖雅各的產業。』」","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華親口說的。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/58.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/59.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/57.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}